Seas will continue to subside through tonight with moderate seas
expected for the offshore zones through the week while nearshore
waters observe moderate to slight seas. During this time frame
gentle to fresh northerly breezes persist. Moderate to fresh
northerly winds return for the weekend, which should lead to rough
